_:nb0b4d0f38c824f868fee3f6f22532099b14 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:null specifies which data values inside the source should be \n        considered as NULL. Defaults to the default NULL character of a source,\n        if available.\n        " .
_:ndd7de0671de24887bb3ddfa1f2024624b6 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        FnO function to execute.\n        " .
